## Scenarios Covered

### Ashoka Textiles
- Priya manages 6 employees and gives them monthly feedback.
- Rohan gives monthly feedback to Priya.
- Kavita can monitor feedback completion as HR.

### Bright Path Consulting
- The founder directly manages 8 employees.
- There is no middle management layer.
- HR can monitor pending submissions.

### Employee History
- Employees can view their feedback history.
- Scores are stored separately for each fixed parameter.
- Each score includes a written reason.
